# SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-only
#
# `Notes` is on the party's bar on Curse of the Azure Bonds, and nothing
# else on the screen is the seam's (#588; not-bars.leg is Pool of
# Radiance's). Curse has one bar where Pool of Radiance has two: the
# overhead view is toggled inside the same loop and keeps it
# (`docs/seams.md` §10). `tests/sessions/curse-quiet-journal.rec` says
# the machine differs from the bar's first draw; this says where on the
# screen it does.
# A pair leg, over `curse-quiet`'s keys, none of which the seam takes.
# Driven on the Steam copy with its shipped slots (`curse-slots`).

about Notes is on the party's bar on Curse, and nowhere else
kind pair
program START.EXE
speed 386
store tests/visual/curse-reader-store.txt
seam journal
until 110000000
every 25

key P@2500
key A@2650
key Return@2800
key L@2950
key A@3100
key B@3250
key Return@3550
key Return@3850
key Left@4000
key Left@4600
key Up@4750
key Return@4900
key Return@5050

# The seventh word's five cells, after the space that follows the bar's
# own thirty-three characters.
rect notes 272,192,311,199

# The boot, the party menu, the load and the opening event's two
# screens: nothing.
allow 0-3850 none

# From the bar's first draw, the dump after the Return that ends the
# opening event: the word, and only while the bar is up. The innkeeper's
# two screens take the bar away and the runs are the same screen there.
allow 3875-end notes
